description_zh:命令就绪炮位开火；有目标时各自瞄准，无目标时沿炮塔当前朝向发射。损坏或装填中的炮位跳过。
description:Order ready turrets to fire. Each turret aims at its own target; without a target it fires along its current barrel direction.
text_zh:光束炮齐射 [%{select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M1').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M1').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M1').readUnitMemory('MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M1').resource.MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M2').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M2').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M2').readUnitMemory('MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M2').resource.MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M3').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M3').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M3').readUnitMemory('MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M3').resource.MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M4').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M4').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M4').readUnitMemory('MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M4').resource.MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M5').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M5').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M5').readUnitMemory('MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_M5').resource.MAX_03_Turret_BeamCannon_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MAX_